UID:25d1ce80-e258-4ebf-a445-7d4caddd1f1f@gds.incidentiq.com
SUMMARY:Parent Connect: for Adoptive Parents
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260422T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260422T200000
DESCRIPTION:Join the counselors and Debbie Riley\, LCMFT\, and CEO at th
 e Center for Adoption Support and Education during National Adoption Aware
 ness Month. Debbie and a panel of adult adoptees will share experiences an
 d offer support for adoptive parents. Families and student support team me
 mbers from other nearby independent schools are also invited.\n\nPlease co
 ntact Meryl Heyliger with questions: mheyliger@gds.org
LOCATION:101 LMS Library
ORGANIZER;CN=Natalie Markley:mailto:nmarkley@gds.org
END:VEVENT
