DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260501T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260501T150000
DESCRIPTION:Fancy Sparkly Day is a GDS event where all community members
  are invited to arrive at school in attire that makes them feel beautiful\
 , but especially things they consider extra fancy or sparkly. Students are
  invited to participate in a fun\, music-filled parade celebrating their i
 ndividuality.
