SUMMARY:Stephanie Burt '89: Taylor Swift at Harvard\, the Future of Poetry\, and Other Mild Surprises
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260122T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260122T200000
DESCRIPTION:Harvard Professor Stephanie Burt '89\, who drew national att
 ention for her course on Taylor Swift\, will be speaking on campus about h
 er new book\, Taylor's Version\, and her journey from GDS student to renow
 ned poet and literary critic.
LOCATION:G001 HS Forum
ORGANIZER;CN=Natalie Markley:mailto:nmarkley@gds.org
END:VEVENT
