UID:dd55adbd-30f3-4c03-9ac8-b2239ca84fa4@gds.incidentiq.com
SUMMARY:LS: Beginning of Year Assessments
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250925T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250925T130000
DESCRIPTION:We begin the school year by getting to know our students aca
 demically\, socially\, and emotionally. We conduct a range of assessments 
 so we can maximize our instruction throughout the year. This session is in
 tended to share with families the different assessments we give students (
 including the Universal Screener\, Speech Screener\, OT Screener\, and MAP
 ) and how to understand the results. The session will start together\, fol
 lowed by breakouts based on the assessments given at various grade levels.
LOCATION:Virtual #01
ORGANIZER;CN=Natalie Markley:mailto:nmarkley@gds.org
END:VEVENT
