 students of color.  MS SOC Mentoring Program is open to all students of co
 lor in middle school. During MS SOC sessions\, students openly discuss the
 ir experiences and concerns as members of the GDS community. Students shar
 e their successes and accomplishments with one another while also learning
  how to use one another as resources in approaching challenges and develop
 ing effective problem-solving strategies.
