 e opportunity to express their dedication and commitment. Lower School mem
 bers of the 1945 Society\, & those who volunteered last year to secure fou
 ndational philanthropic support for the School\, will be celebrated at a b
 runch gratitude gathering following the Lower School Dance Assembly.
