UID:6358a772-7b72-4078-9d99-fc0aa712d39f@gds.incidentiq.com
SUMMARY:Annual GDS Alumni Challenge 2 Mile Run/Walk
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250816T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250816T120000
DESCRIPTION:An opportunity for GDS running alumni to return and run agai
 n with former coaches\, teachers\, and current members of the GDS running 
 teams.  Runners and walkers of all ages are encouraged to come out to part
 icipate in this low-key\, free race along a flat course beside the beautif
 ul C & O Canal. No registration necessary.\n\nThe race begins and ends in 
 the Fletcher's Cove Boathouse parking lot (4940 Canal Rd NW\, Washington\,
  DC 20007 - Corner of Canal Road & Reservoir Road).\nEmail: abelber@gds.or
 g
LOCATION:Offsite #01
ORGANIZER;CN=Natalie Markley:mailto:nmarkley@gds.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:68f17a09-629e-4ad8-858b-0cbcc3978d7f@gds.incidentiq.com
SUMMARY:10th\, 11th & 12th Grade New Student Orientation
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250815T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250815T160000
DESCRIPTION:All new-to-GDS 10th\, 11th and 12th graders will gather for 
 a chance to meet each other\, learn about the culture of the high school\,
  connect with some current students\, meet with staff (teachers\, deans\, 
 administrators)\, and get familiar with the building before the first day 
 of school.\n\nQuestions? hsoffice@gds.org
LOCATION:G002
ORGANIZER;CN=Natalie Markley:mailto:nmarkley@gds.org
END:VEVENT
