DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250814T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250814T190000
DESCRIPTION:Do you have questions about our commute to GDS for Fall\, 20
 25? Join one of our upcoming information sessions. During these sessions\,
  we will talk through the various options and restrictions related to comm
 uting to GDS and answer questions that you might have. We will also be abl
 e to help you determine what commuting method is best for your family.  \n
 \nIf you have any questions\, please feel free to reach out to ImproveMyCo
 mmute@gds.org.
LOCATION:Virtual #01
ORGANIZER;CN=Natalie Markley:mailto:nmarkley@gds.org
END:VEVENT
